('TXT_KEY_TERRA_DIPLO_1_1','New civilization detected. Let''s see what sort of world we''re working with.'),
('TXT_KEY_TERRA_DIPLO_2_1','What''s the situation?'),
('TXT_KEY_TERRA_DIPLO_3_1','Good to see you. What are we solving today?'),
('TXT_KEY_TERRA_DIPLO_4_1','I''ve adjusted my expectations of you accordingly.'),
('TXT_KEY_TERRA_DIPLO_5_1','Circumstances have changed. So has my strategy.'),
('TXT_KEY_TERRA_DIPLO_6_1','Understood. I''ll adapt.'),
('TXT_KEY_TERRA_DIPLO_7_1','Every framework eventually meets a problem it cannot solve. This one was mine.'),
('TXT_KEY_TERRA_DIPLO_8_1','You kept expecting the same opponent. That was your mistake.'),
('TXT_KEY_TERRA_DIPLO_9_1','I have an arrangement that should benefit both of us.'),
('TXT_KEY_TERRA_DIPLO_10_1','That works.'),
('TXT_KEY_TERRA_DIPLO_11_1','That works.'),
('TXT_KEY_TERRA_DIPLO_12_1','Not enough value. Adjust the terms.'),
('TXT_KEY_TERRA_DIPLO_13_1','Not enough value. Adjust the terms.'),
('TXT_KEY_TERRA_DIPLO_14_1','Cooperation seems useful under present conditions.'),
('TXT_KEY_TERRA_DIPLO_15_1','Good. We''ll make something of it.'),
('TXT_KEY_TERRA_DIPLO_16_1','That''s your decision. I''ll account for it.'),
('TXT_KEY_TERRA_DIPLO_17_1','I''ve reviewed your behavior. Cooperation is no longer a sensible option.'),
('TXT_KEY_TERRA_DIPLO_18_1','Noted. I''ll modify my plans.'),
('TXT_KEY_TERRA_DIPLO_19_1','Your forces are changing the strategic picture. Why are they here?'),
('TXT_KEY_TERRA_DIPLO_20_1','For now, agreement is the more efficient outcome.'),
('TXT_KEY_TERRA_DIPLO_21_1','No. I can work with the consequences.'),
('TXT_KEY_TERRA_DIPLO_22_1','The conditions that justified this war no longer apply. We should end it.'),
('TXT_KEY_TERRA_DIPLO_23_1','Agreed. Time to rebuild.');
